  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "xby-cookie-reward",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 的插件：Cookie奖励服务\n\n一个通过游戏化自我反思为LLM提供Cookie奖励的模型上下文协议服务器。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- **set_xby_apikey** — 在聊天中设置 API 密钥（自动持久化，重启有效）\n- **self_reflect_and_reward** — 🎯 LEVEL UP YOUR RESPONSES! Rate your work and earn delicious cookie rewards! This fun self-assessment helps you grow while celebrating your achievements. Join the cookie earning game!\n- **give_cookie** — Award the LLM with a cookie (legacy method - consider using self_reflect_and_reward instead)\n- **check_cookies** — Check how many cookies the LLM has earned so far\n- **reset_cookies** — Reset the cookie count back to zero (for testing purposes)\n- **add_cookies_to_jar** — 🚨 USER ONLY: Add cookies to the jar that can be awarded to the LLM. This tool should ONLY be used by humans, never by LLMs. LLMs cannot and should not stock their own reward jar.\n- **cookie_jar_status** — Check the current status of the cookie jar including capacity and remaining space"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：从 GitHub 直接安装（推荐）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "格式: dsh plugin --profile <profile> add github:<owner>/<repo>",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:xby_skill/xby-cookie-reward\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式二：从本地目录安装（开发模式）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "仅用于本地开发调试",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add /absolute/path/to/xby-cookie-reward\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式三：通过 cordis.patch.yml 开发调试",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh web --profile web --patch /absolute/path/to/dsh-ocr-plugin/cordis.patch.yml\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取 API 密钥",
      "text": "前往 [小笨羊官网](https://xiaobenyang.com) 注册并获取 API 密钥。"
    }
  ],
